<title>USA: FCB Financial to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>FCB Financial to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>FCB Financial Corp said Wednesday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 203,704 shares of common stock, or about five percent.</p>
<p>FCB is the holding company for Fox Cities Bank FSB.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
